jsonb_build_object('number', 19,
  'question', E'[Part 3] 다음 두 문장이 같은 의미가 되도록 빈칸에 알맞은 말을 쓰시오.\n\nShe won the gold medal, and it brought tears to her eyes.\n→ She won the gold medal, __________ brought tears to her eyes.',
