  'question', E'다음 두 문장이 같은 의미가 되도록 빈칸에 알맞은 말을 쓰시오.\n\nShe forgot to mention the most important detail, which confused the entire audience.\n→ She forgot to mention the most important detail, __________ __________ confused the entire audience.',
