  'question', E'다음 두 문장이 같은 의미가 되도록 빈칸에 알맞은 말을 쓰시오.\n\nShe is a gifted musician, who doesn''t practice nearly as much as she should.\n→ She is a gifted musician, __________ __________ __________ __________ __________ __________ __________ __________.',
